{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从根节点开始，依次交换每个节点的左、右子树；交换根节点后，两棵子树整体换位，再继续处理子树内部。动画使用示例 1 展示三次关键交换，所有节点各处理一次，因此时间复杂度为 O(n)，递归调用栈最坏为 O(n)。空树不需要处理，直接返回空树。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>翻转二叉树可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .subtitle { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .card { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; }\n  .status { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .step { padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: #0e639c; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 10px; }\n  .message { font-size: 12px; }\n  .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .tree-wrap { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; padding: 4px 0; }\n  svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; max-height: 200px; }\n  .edge { stroke: #3c3c3c; stroke-width: 2; transition: stroke .35s; }\n  .node circle { fill: #252526; stroke: #3c3c3c; stroke-width: 2; transition: fill .35s, stroke .35s; }\n  .node text { fill: #d4d4d4; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: central; }\n  .node.current circle { fill: #0e639c; stroke: #3794ff; }\n  .node.child circle { fill: #263f55; stroke: #3794ff; }\n  .node.done circle { stroke: #4ec9b0; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; }\n  .dot.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .dot.child { background: #263f55; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .dot.done { border-color: #4ec9b0; }\n  .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .panel { padding: 8px 10px; background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; }\n  .panel h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .array { padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #252526; color: #9cdcfe; font-size: 12px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .rule { margin: 0; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .rule strong { color: #3794ff; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>翻转二叉树</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">root = [4,2,7,1,3,6,9]</span></p>\n\n  <section class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"status\">\n      <span class=\"step\" id=\"stepLabel\">第 0 步</span>\n      <span class=\"message\" id=\"message\">从原树开始，准备交换根节点的左右子树。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tree-wrap\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"翻转二叉树动画\">\n        <g id=\"edges\"></g>\n        <g id=\"nodes\"></g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot current\"></span>当前交换节点</span>\n      <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot child\"></span>即将互换的孩子</span>\n      <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot done\"></span>已经处理</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"details\">\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h2>当前层序结果</h2>\n      <div class=\"array mono\" id=\"arrayText\">[4,2,7,1,3,6,9]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h2>核心操作</h2>\n      <p class=\"rule\">访问一个节点时，交换它的 <strong>左孩子</strong> 与 <strong>右孩子</strong>，再继续处理两棵子树。</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const positions = [\n    [400, 55],\n    [235, 155], [565, 155],\n    [145, 275], [315, 275], [485, 275], [655, 275]\n  ];\n\n  const states = [\n    {\n      values: [4,2,7,1,3,6,9], current: 0, children: [1,2], done: [],\n      label: '第 0 步', message: '原树：先观察根节点 4 的左右子树。'\n    },\n    {\n      values: [4,7,2,6,9,1,3], current: 0, children: [1,2], done: [0],\n      label: '第 1 步', message: '交换节点 4 的左右孩子：子树 2 与子树 7 整体换位。'\n    },\n    {\n      values: [4,7,2,9,6,1,3], current: 1, children: [3,4], done: [0,1],\n      label: '第 2 步', message: '交换节点 7 的左右孩子：6 与 9 换位。'\n    },\n    {\n      values: [4,7,2,9,6,3,1], current: 2, children: [5,6], done: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\n      label: '第 3 步', message: '交换节点 2 的左右孩子：1 与 3 换位，翻转完成。'\n    }\n  ];\n\n  const edgePairs = [[0,1],[0,2],[1,3],[1,4],[2,5],[2,6]];\n  const edges = document.getElementById('edges');\n  const nodes = document.getElementById('nodes');\n\n  edgePairs.forEach(([a,b]) => {\n    const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');\n    line.setAttribute('class', 'edge');\n    line.setAttribute('x1', positions[a][0]);\n    line.setAttribute('y1', positions[a][1] + 30);\n    line.setAttribute('x2', positions[b][0]);\n    line.setAttribute('y2', positions[b][1] - 30);\n    edges.appendChild(line);\n  });\n\n  positions.forEach(([x,y], index) => {\n    const group = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'g');\n    group.setAttribute('class', 'node');\n    group.setAttribute('data-index', index);\n    const circle = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');\n    circle.setAttribute('cx', x);\n    circle.setAttribute('cy', y);\n    circle.setAttribute('r', 31);\n    const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');\n    text.setAttribute('x', x);\n    text.setAttribute('y', y + 1);\n    group.append(circle, text);\n    nodes.appendChild(group);\n  });\n\n  let index = 0;\n  function render() {\n    const state = states[index];\n    document.getElementById('stepLabel').textContent = state.label;\n    document.getElementById('message').textContent = state.message;\n    document.getElementById('arrayText').textContent = '[' + state.values.join(',') + ']';\n\n    [...nodes.children].forEach((group, i) => {\n      group.setAttribute('class', 'node');\n      if (state.done.includes(i)) group.classList.add('done');\n      if (state.children.includes(i)) group.classList.add('child');\n      if (i === state.current) group.classList.add('current');\n      group.querySelector('text').textContent = state.values[i];\n    });\n\n    index = (index + 1) % states.length;\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(render, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(h)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是节点数, h 是树高. 原地交换每个节点的左右孩子一次; 递归栈最坏 O(n), 平衡树 O(log n), 不复制树."
}
